        "content": "Subject: Update on Export Feature Release: One-Week Delay\n\nDear Customer,\n\nWe are writing to inform you that the release of the new export feature, originally scheduled for [Original Date], has been delayed by one week. The new target release date is [New Date].\n\n**What Happened**\nDuring our final validation phase, our engineering team identified a data-integrity issue affecting a specific subset of export formats. While the feature functions correctly for most use cases, this issue could result in incomplete or inaccurate data for certain complex datasets. We determined that releasing the feature with this known issue would not meet our quality standards.\n\n**What We Are Doing**\nOur engineering team has isolated the root cause and is currently implementing a fix. We are also expanding our automated test suite to include scenarios that cover the edge cases identified during validation. This ensures that the issue is fully resolved and prevents similar regressions in future updates.\n\n**What to Expect Next**\nWe anticipate completing the fix and re-validation by [New Date]. We will send a confirmation email once the feature is live and available for use. No action is required on your part during this period.\n\n**Support for Urgent Cases**\nIf you have an urgent need to export data before the new release, please contact our support team at [Support Email/Link]. We can provide manual export assistance or alternative workarounds to help you meet immediate deadlines.\n\nWe apologize for this delay and appreciate your patience as we ensure the feature meets the reliability standards you expect from us.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Job Title]\n[Company Name]"
